[{"title":"渡奔牛闸","author":"史鉴","text":"下河水低上河漫，春雷吼闸奔流悍。\n鼓声鼕鼕催发船，百丈牵连若鱼贯。\n船头水涌沉且浮，顺风张帆那可留。\n行人来往日南北，惟有水声千古流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15331,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吕城坝","author":"史鉴","text":"河水汤汤向东注，垒土横河障波住。\n往来舟楫恒苦停，首尾相衔才得渡。\n车声辚辚绠痕急，船头向天如欲立。\n龙门一跃直下来，滩声雷吼鲛人泣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15332,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题可庵老人写竹","author":"史鉴","text":"国初写竹王舍人，笔端生动妙入神。\n风流太常继其后，片纸一出人争取。\n可庵老人得此传，声价在人尤赫然。\n江南贤豪动百数，家家屏障生风烟。\n前年寄我雪竹图，天地惨淡云模糊。\n大枝横斜小枝亚，金鞭击折青珊瑚。\n今年写竹吴江见，写出千人万人羡。\n鸾凤盘空云日翻，蛟龙出海风雷变。\n鹧鸪无声锦瑟稀，湘娥披云未遮面。\n老人老人勿自珍，笔力转多方绝伦。\n高山流水志有在，莫谓识面无其人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15333,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许子厚约游石湖余以事沮诗以谢之","author":"史鉴","text":"杭州擅西湖，烟花瀰漫天下无。\n石湖在吴苑，佳丽亦足雄吾苏。\n青山巃嵷抱湖涘，吴台越城两荒址。\n紫薇舍人天上归，乞得天书贲湖水。\n湖水东西流，世人相续游。\n古人不可见，今人来不休。\n古人今人日更改，湖上青山镇长在。\n梵宇琳宫几废兴，湖波依旧东流海。\n许君约客为春游，绣被锦帆青翰舟。\n攀岩践穴肆探讨，□洄击汰相夷猷。\n山岚湖渌可手掬，大笑拂入杯中浮。\n举杯仰天作鲸吸，沃溉胃肾资冥搜。\n时时得句辄呕出，锦囊错落骊珠投。\n暮归列炬照湖上，水波涌沸鱼龙泅。\n蹇余汲汲尘中走，与约谁知此言负。\n想像清欢寤寐间，侧身西望长搔首。\n作诗聊寓不平鸣，有命重游尚须后。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15334,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈启南西林唱和","author":"史鉴","text":"故人访我来长洲，半道却入西林游。\n西林萧萧倚绝壁，仰见白日西南流。\n林僧昼眠开北牖，惊呼谓是吾师友。\n遣人四出招良朋，露坐中庭接杯酒。\n东方月出星满天，抗袖起舞心茫然。\n白璧无由报知己，丹砂不复延流年。\n延流年，真浪语。\n何如饮美酒，沉酣不知暑。\n昙花菲香充佛庐，爝火流光骇仙鼠。\n既歌且谣，其乐陶陶。\n不有君子，那能逍遥。\n诗成写图徐隐几，顷刻云烟生满纸。\n天机到处人莫知，明日喧传动城市。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15335,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万竹亭赋赠吴汝琇","author":"史鉴","text":"我家竹林在平地，土浅丛疏叶憔悴。\n君家万竹连高岗，俪美潇湘与清渭。\n崖光谷色相吐吞，石涧潺湲潆复奔。\n鹧鸪啼秋白日暝，蛟龙捲雨翻沧溟。\n红泥亭子开中央，朱阑碧甃周为防，孔屏翠帐齐腾光。\n秋兰罗生瑶径旁，光风泛转菲菲香。\n翠阴满地凝不散，绿水荡漾云茫茫。\n美人挟瑟调清商，朱弦高张分雁行。\n一弹再鼓发浩倡，清声入云哀怨长。\n凤凰翱翔下寥廓，帝子不见山苍苍。\n我为万竹歌，歌长唾壶缺。\n平生不饮今醉之，醉后不禁双耳热。\n夜深起舞月明中，猛虎一声山石裂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15336,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春访沈启南道中作","author":"史鉴","text":"姑苏城中桃李花，风吹雨批成泥沙。\n离群客子正无赖，对此不饮空咨嗟。\n美人别来应瘦生，思之忽泛娄江行。\n芳洲杜若何青青，青林隔岸啼春莺。\n春莺嘤嘤求友声，人之听之无限情。\n无限情，在今夕，疑义奇文赏还析。\n大胜山阴兴尽回，道路空留往来迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15337,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳庵","author":"史鉴","text":"我游重阳庵，不见重阳子。\n丹成飘然与世辞，骑龙遨游太清里。\n三山等鳌簪，四海犹杯水。\n万里一瞬间，千年片时耳。\n后人作屋青山头，重阳不来人自游。\n长风萧萧日杲杲，醉卧白石临清流。\n青衣洞，深且幽，衔花野鹿鸣呦呦。\n仰招浮云唤白鹤，吾将与尔仍丹邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15338,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送莫同知弟北归赴试","author":"史鉴","text":"省墓才南下，辞家又北征。\n淮山临驿路，易水绕都城。\n夜雨鸰原梦，春风雁塔名。\n遥知曲江畔，骑马看花行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15339,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴铁峰","author":"史鉴","text":"春色浓如酒，行行劝一杯。\n送君嗟此别，执手问重来。\n野鸟迎人语，林花著雨开。\n维舟未忍发，日暮更徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15340,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹房","author":"史鉴","text":"爱此竹房好，偏宜方外情。\n前村江动月，清梵昼销声。\n讲后雨花乱，风来天籁鸣。\n与师分半榻，高卧尽馀生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15341,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送母舅朱渔隐","author":"史鉴","text":"十年才一见，离合动悲伤。\n授璧投河水，驱车送渭阳。\n青山明夕照，黄菊款秋光。\n莫惜频来过，慈亲鬓已霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15342,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斗室为澄道岩赋","author":"史鉴","text":"斗室开幽处，云门俯水涯。\n四方裁十笏，一座演三车。\n檐短容明月，窗低映杂花。\n休言此中小，世界亦恒沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15343,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅轩为李天瑞赋","author":"史鉴","text":"爱此梅花好，移来对草堂。\n水边微见影，雪里只闻香。\n庾岭春如海，西湖月似霜。\n从教日吹笛，无梦到含章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15344,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴溪草堂","author":"史鉴","text":"继志能归璧，贻谋在肯堂。\n重来山不改，旧种树加长。\n燕雀晓相贺，芝兰春更芳。\n还闻放鸡犬，犹自认门墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15345,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和吕别驾九日登姑苏台韵","author":"史鉴","text":"偶遇登高节，相为吊古游。\n砧声吴苑暮，雁影太湖秋。\n得句频催和，行杯更旅酬。\n风流堪入画，妙手学营邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15346,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一鹤为南京唐道士赋","author":"史鉴","text":"爱尔仙家骥，苍松映缟衣。\n一声清夜唳，片影上天飞。\n赤壁横江过，青城被箭归。\n飘然游物外，几见世人非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15347,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊虎山桥","author":"史鉴","text":"雨后水初漫，日斜山更明。\n地居吴下胜，人似越中行。\n扫石看题字，临流试濯缨。\n桥南一亭好，新得翰林名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15348,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"憩奉慈庵","author":"史鉴","text":"松头孤鹤下，石罅乱泉鸣。\n入坞疑无路，逢山屡问名。\n客行忘远近，僧老废将迎。\n一笑出门去，五湖风浪生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15349,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送范世良","author":"史鉴","text":"弱柳不堪折，相携话水边。\n离杯传日暮，归路在春先。\n冻雪寒欺马，空江晓渡船。\n永怀交际久，况是昔人贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15350,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊庄","author":"史鉴","text":"种菊久成庄，门前水亦香。\n花时常把酒，日暮拟为粮。\n正色纯无杂，遐龄老未央。\n何当事筐筥，来此采馀芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15351,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽萧以信","author":"史鉴","text":"人道从军乐，谁知误一生。\n元戎归旅榇，边将失干城。\n草檄今无敌，封侯竟不成。\n空遗旧提剑，沦落海西营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15352,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送康驿丞还庐陵","author":"史鉴","text":"握手独相送，君行我自归。\n风波千里远，烟树一村微。\n地胜金鱼近，江清白鹭飞。\n鸰原应在念，回首思依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15353,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴兴道中有怀汝其通曹颙若","author":"史鉴","text":"杳杳长途异，悠悠逝水流。\n江村孤宿夜，风雪远行舟。\n寒重偏欺客，凌浮迥结愁。\n故人应在念，日暮尚登楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15354,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿奉先寺洪上人房","author":"史鉴","text":"孤舟薄暮宿，古寺奉先名。\n地迥诸天近，楼高片月明。\n炉香清作供，漏水冻消声。\n爱此无生说，流连过二更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15355,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吴铁峰家假山","author":"史鉴","text":"仲子为山处，容人得屡过。\n峰峦平地起，水木到门多。\n欲雨生云雾，经春长薜萝。\n流莺如惬意，百啭杂笙歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15356,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄慈感寺一峰上人","author":"史鉴","text":"能诗兰谷老，化去已多年。\n霅上一峰秀，灯前三昩传。\n莲花滴漏水，月色照归船。\n记得长松下，曾参玉版禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15357,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤山","author":"史鉴","text":"一上孤山望，春波带夕曛。\n西来千嶂合，南下两湖分。\n路绕前朝寺，云埋处士坟。\n画船归去晚，歌吹月中闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15358,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送灵隐书记净无瑕游京师","author":"史鉴","text":"披衣新得戒，杖锡又登程。\n世路随缘去，空门为法行。\n浮云上国远，片月故山明。\n心地平如水，风波自不惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15359,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与汝其通观钱塘江","author":"史鉴","text":"渺渺春江迥，无风亦有声。\n地平波动石，海接气浮城。\n战马屯砂碛，潮头也世情。\n临流将唤渡，南向越中行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15360,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天申宫","author":"史鉴","text":"问讯天申路，期寻福地游。\n风林松子落，石窦乳泉流。\n溪女行随伴，山花插满头。\n道人能好客，炬火不须求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15361,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游报忠寺","author":"史鉴","text":"选佛开名刹，因山号善权。\n地深青嶂合，天近白云连。\n门对长松树，池分小洞泉。\n不知楹上篆，雷震是何年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15362,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经下菰城","author":"史鉴","text":"靡怀函谷败，却事下菰营。\n蕞尔非天险，当时盛甲兵。\n空城乌鸟乐，废堞野云平。\n不独吴宫里，离离蔓草生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15363,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溧阳道中","author":"史鉴","text":"水尽行舟止，途平抗策宜。\n车声来往道，天气雨晴时。\n赤阪黄尘起，青山碧草滋。\n居人当路语，留客饭松茨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15364,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经濑水","author":"史鉴","text":"匍匐昭关下，仓皇濑水浔。\n饭贤同漂母，报德异淮阴。\n一死名无忝，千金漫尔沉。\n停车吊遗迹，长叹不成吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15365,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鲁廷瞻叶廷缙徐宪之送至龙江而别夜坐有怀","author":"史鉴","text":"晚泊龙江上，君归我未行。\n乘流喜风顺，看月待潮生。\n水市浮舟卖，渔灯入夜明。\n乡心与离思，扰扰梦难成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15366,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其一 梦泽晴云","author":"史鉴","text":"渺渺江南梦，英英云上生。\n绪风吹不散，悬火照还明。\n凉沁皋兰被，晴连湖水平。\n时飞傍亲舍，游子若为情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15367,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其二 章台古迹","author":"史鉴","text":"全楚疲兴筑，诸侯贺落成。\n侈心滋未足，大屈好非诚。\n往事不可问，野花空复情。\n秋禽委毛羽，犹似断王旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15368,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其三 沱溪晓渡","author":"史鉴","text":"利涉在崇朝，沱溪一水遥。\n谁能须我友，多是就人招。\n乘月影零乱，傍船波动摇。\n晨鸡犹喔喔，客路正迢迢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15369,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其四 东山雪霁","author":"史鉴","text":"山峰尽奇绝，雪羃更精神。\n玉笋抽当震，瑶簪出奠寅。\n高低同一色，草木借三春。\n欲访仙庐迹，漫漫认未真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15370,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其五 南山远翠","author":"史鉴","text":"湖水流无际，山形荡欲漂。\n云生齐北斗，脉衍自南条。\n朱凤高飞尽，苍梧别望遥。\n禹功垂万古，祠宇亦萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15371,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其六 板桥春涨","author":"史鉴","text":"横木为梁处，舟车日夜过。\n彩虹垂饮渚，灵鹊下填河。\n雪水西从蜀，湖流北受沱。\n吞崖溷牛马，鸣濑失蛟鼍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15372,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其七 杏村夕照","author":"史鉴","text":"斜日章台下，杏花犹自红。\n古今皆过客，开落尽春风。\n楚芉腰支细，息妫言笑通。\n那能久容冶，相映酒帘中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15373,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其八 青湖夜月","author":"史鉴","text":"水月原同气，高卑特异形。\n运行常不息，流动亦无停。\n象纬昭天阙，容光小洞庭。\n浮槎失南北，隐隐数峰青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15374,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其九 赤亭遗址","author":"史鉴","text":"亭废独遗基，灵踪托雨师。\n湖山元自胜，风月故相宜。\n龙驾云中度，鸾笙岭上吹。\n世人空想像，赍酒日来嬉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15375,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华容十咏为毛同府赋 其十 驿路松风","author":"史鉴","text":"驿路长松树，风来作万呺。\n龙吟翻翠盖，凤舞奏琅璈。\n列陈初严鼓，连营乍竖旄。\n犹疑宋飞将，水上战方鏖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15376,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游三茅观","author":"史鉴","text":"山势西来尽，江流北望遥。\n神仙长在世，日夜再闻潮。\n药采新生术，篱编旧种椒。\n不须句曲远，聊此永今朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15377,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜投殊胜寺真上人房","author":"史鉴","text":"春风苦无赖，野寺暂相依。\n静夜名香遍，空堂漏水微。\n语投机自息，坐久世疑非。\n爱尔东林月，流光照客衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15378,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日","author":"史鉴","text":"流年今六十，壮志日蹉跎。\n得此已为幸，更来能几何。\n青山游未遍，白发在无多。\n去去不须道，逢春且啸歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15379,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日","author":"史鉴","text":"北向梅开未，东行月建寅。\n有生皆自乐，无处不宜春。\n似我容颜老，逢兹气象新。\n百年今大半，犹是未閒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15380,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒张子静墓","author":"史鉴","text":"弭棹鸿村道，来寻处士坟。\n泪痕沾宿草，悲思接愁云。\n系树嗟无剑，名家幸有文。\n东风吹野水，流响不堪闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15381,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧岩","author":"史鉴","text":"问路扪萝上，遥寻钟磬声。\n云流看栋湿，树挺识人行。\n涧水晴悬瀑，松风巧韵筝。\n山苍与湖绿，点染自天成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15382,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瀑布泉","author":"史鉴","text":"爱此岩头瀑，分明白练垂。\n被风吹不断，得雨洒尤奇。\n流出有来处，散开无尽期。\n庐山亮同此，只欠商仙诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15383,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸭绿漾","author":"史鉴","text":"近接太湖水，倒涵苍弁峰。\n地无高丽险，色比汉江醲。\n荡漾数十顷，岚霏三四重。\n碧岩长在望，日暮忽闻钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15384,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大雷小雷","author":"史鉴","text":"双螺浸湖水，万古镇龙宫。\n小大名形异，东西奠位同。\n尝闻出光怪，于此验凶丰。\n欲往叹无翼，凭谁学御风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15385,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与沈启南从徐亚卿何中丞相度水道 其一 渡吴淞江","author":"史鉴","text":"济世未为术，逢人聊用情。\n海桑惟日变，水土几时平。\n远雁和云杳，寒潮趁月生。\n茫茫不相识，沿路问乡名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15386,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与沈启南从徐亚卿何中丞相度水道 其二 宿徐公浦","author":"史鉴","text":"暂出靡行役，邻封非异乡。\n偶因停泊处，始定往来方。\n海迥月浮水，夜寒天雨霜。\n终宵成辗转，归梦与途长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15387,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与沈启南从徐亚卿何中丞相度水道 其三 经上海县","author":"史鉴","text":"岸崩桥易圮，水阔渡难招。\n浦溆遥通海，舟航半趁潮。\n市声先旦集，野树未霜凋。\n明月如相识，依依伴寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15388,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与沈启南从徐亚卿何中丞相度水道 其四 至松江府","author":"史鉴","text":"不到云间久，于今四十春。\n山川仍旧物，交友半陈人。\n梵井鳗光泯，华亭鹤唳新。\n扁舟有归兴，斜日下通津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15389,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和石田自寿诗韵","author":"史鉴","text":"流年今四纪，强半在城中。\n画好能名世，文成拟送穷。\n趋庭欢令子，勿药喜而翁。\n昨夜灯前饮，清吟对阿同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15390,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登吴山绝顶","author":"史鉴","text":"古庙经年久，荒台落叶深。\n江湖分向背，城市绕山林。\n尽道迎秋榜，谁同坐夕阴。\n樵歌归满路，惊散暮栖禽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15391,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭林侍御五首 其一","author":"史鉴","text":"远闻林侍御，一梦掩泉宫。\n陇树犹森柏，山灵已避骢。\n祸消未萌际，勇退急流中。\n无限忧时泪，因君泣未穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15392,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭林侍御五首 其二","author":"史鉴","text":"云掩前星位，人心去就间。\n惟公上封事，深斥柄臣奸。\n灞上空留说，梁王竟出关。\n大功安社稷，瞻望孰能班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15393,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭林侍御五首 其三","author":"史鉴","text":"解绶归田日，相呼在驿楼。\n共嗟临水别，真作此生休。\n忽得莆中问，今为地下游。\n空挥两行泪，寄与海波流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":15394,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]